cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Conversational AI increases political knowledge as effectively as self-directed internet search: analysis code and data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and de-identified data for two studies on UK samples around the 2024
  general election: a nationally representative survey of conversational AI use for
  politically relevant information, and randomised controlled trials comparing
  task-directed AI conversation against self-directed internet search.
